---
heading: Make merch with us
intro: >-
  Need shirts, posters, or a full merch run? We handle the whole thing — art, print,
  and delivery — whether it's for a band, a business, or a one-time event.
offeringsHeading: What we offer
offerings:
  - title: Shirts & apparel
    body: Screen-printed tees, long sleeves, and hoodies in small runs. One colour or several.
  - title: Posters & prints
    body: Hand-drawn, numbered, and signed if you want them to be. Show posters, art prints, promo runs.
  - title: Custom artwork
    body: Original hand-drawn art for your release, your brand, or your event — yours to keep.
  - title: Restocks & reprints
    body: Sell out and need more? We hold onto your screens and can run it again.
stepsHeading: How it works
steps:
  - title: Reach out
    body: Tell us the idea, how many pieces, and when you need them.
  - title: We quote it
    body: You get a price per piece and a timeline before anything is committed.
  - title: We draw it
    body: Concepts and revisions until it's right. The final art is yours to keep.
  - title: We print & deliver
    body: Small-run screen printing, then pickup in Winona or shipped to you.
ctaHeading: Let's talk
ctaBody: >-
  Send us a note with your project, your timeline, and any art you already have. We'll
  get back to you fast.
---
